{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40077","headline":"钓丝竹 · 徐夤","name":"钓丝竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藋藋拂清流，堪维舴艋舟。\n野虫悬作饵，溪月曲爲钩。\n雨润摇堦长，风吹绕指柔。\n若将诸树比，还使绿杨羞。\n蚕妇非尧女，渔人是子猷。\n湖边旧栽处，长映读书楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}